      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T18:16:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here are some thoughts, I think this is a good start but it\u0027s a complicated problem, so we\u0027ll need to iterate on it for a bit.",
      "revId": "40864980e8bf04b669bfccb078211d63bfd6408f",
